sort_dir.description:
Sort direction. Possible values:

``asc`` — ascending;

``desc`` — descending

bgp_router_id.description:
BGP router ID. Recommendations for the value to specify:

- use the highest IP address on the loopback interface;
- use the highest IP address on the physical interface

dc_bgp_neighbor_add_paths.description:
Neighbor operation mode. Determines the ability to exchange all routing variants for each announcement.

Possible values:

``off`` — disabled;

``on`` — enabled in both directions;

``rx`` — enabled for receiving only;

``tx`` — enabled for sending only

dc_ip_port_forwarding_rw_props_protocol.description:
Data transfer protocol. Possible values:

``tcp`` — the rule applies to the specified port over the TCP protocol;

``udp`` — the rule applies to the specified port over the UDP protocol;``any`` — the rule applies to all ports and protocols
